==Battleground==
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 91% HP:
**1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 87% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similar to [[Aimless Dialogue]] and [[Hall of the Four Kings]], this is a base hit stage where hitting the base gives you a single enemy to deal with. Unlike those two stages, you have to fight a Mini White Cyclone each time as well. [[Cyberpunk Cat]] and [[Sniper the Deadeye]] as per usual minimize the threat of each enemy here, while none of the enemies here specifically pose much of a threat.

Ursamajor dies to [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and well-timed [[Supercar Cat]]s. Use this time to build up money and send out Cyberpunk. When Mini White Cyclone comes out, Cyberpunk can control it while [[Fishman Cat]] hits Mini White Cyclone for high damage.

While Golem Sunfish seems like a joke pick here, your stack pinning him to the base can actually be a danger if it's large enough, as this stage's enemy limit allows multiple waves to appear, and you do not want to have to fight two Mini White Cyclones, Midnite D., and Golem Sunfish all at the same time. Let Mini White Cyclone kill your meatshields before you murder it with Fishman, and make sure your Cyberpunk doesn't die to Golem Sunfish.

Midnite D. dies to Supercar, timed Jelly Dumplings, or whatever anti-Aku stuff you might want to use here. Not really that bad.

The final wave is Winged Pigge, who can be [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Catcrates]] locked into a Freeze chain. With Winged Pigge unable to Weaken, your Fishmans have free reign to deal with the final Mini White Cyclone.

